            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A modular door unit (100) which is configured to be connectable to a modular construction, such as a stand at a trade fair, wherein the door unit comprises a door panel (110) and a frame (120),wherein the door panel is connected rotatably to the frame so that the door panel is rotatable between at least one open position and a closed position, wherein access through the door unit is allowed in the at least one open position and access through the door unit is impeded in the closed position,wherein the door unit further comprises at least one fastening means (130) which is connected to the frame and is configured to connect the frame releasably to the modular construction so that the door unit is mountable and demountable in the modular construction,wherein the door unit further comprises a handle (140) with at least one engaging element (141), wherein the handle (140) is displaceable between a first position and a second position.</p>
            </abstract>
